          Shovelware-/Micro-Platin-Filter sowie direkter Community-Fehlerreport.
        </p>
        <p lang="en">
          TrophyBase is a modern, ad-free web app for trophy hunters: interactive real-time
          checklists for trophies, walkthroughs, collectibles and bosses, precise video
          timestamps in landscape split-screen, a built-in shovelware/micro-platinum filter,
          and direct community error reporting.
        </p>
